<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivar slightly up at 475.25/476.25.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivar slightly up at 475.25/476.25.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed slightly up at 475.25/476.25 per dollar in a very quiet market with no Central Bank presence, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;It was really very quiet. With almost everybody taking the rest of the day off from noon, you can't expect much,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>On Monday, the unit closed at 475.50/476.50</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 834405))</p>
